  "elevationPhilosophy": "The system intentionally avoids drop shadows. Elevation is communicated through fill contrast — white cards on warm bone surfaces, pastel cards on white, black cards on photo backgrounds — and through the dramatic black bands that act as full-bleed separators. The absence of shadows is a deliberate choice that keeps the page feeling flat, modern, and graphic, letting the orange and lime accents do the visual lifting instead of shadow stacks.",
